<P/>
<table style="background-color:#004400">
  <tr>
    <td colspan="2" style="color: white; text-align:center">
      &nbsp;&nbsp;Primary data source&nbsp;&nbsp;
    </td>
    <td style="color: white; text-align:center">
      Query NIST Bibliographic Database for <b>Fe  I</b> (new window)
    </td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
<!--    <td style="text-align:center; background-color:#DDDDBB">-->
    <td class='brt2'>
      &nbsp;<a onmouseover="self.status='Bibliographic Reference for Fe I';return true;" onmouseout="self.status='';return true;" target="_blank" href="javascript:void(0)" onclick="popded('https://physics.nist.gov/cgi-bin/ASBib1/get_ASBib_ref.cgi?db=el&amp;db_id=11631&amp;comment_code=&amp;element=Fe&amp;spectr_charge=1&amp;type=E');return false">Nave et al. 1994</a>&nbsp;
    </td>
    <td class='blf2'>
      &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;The wavenumber measurements in Nave et al 1994 were calibrated with respect to Ar&nbsp;II lines measured by <a onmouseover="self.status='Bibliographic Reference for Fe I';return true;" onmouseout="self.status='';return true;" target="_blank" href="javascript:void(0)" onclick="popded('https://physics.nist.gov/cgi-bin/ASBib1/get_ASBib_ref.cgi?db=el&amp;db_id=2634&amp;comment_code=&amp;element=Fe&amp;spectr_charge=1&amp;type=E');return false">Norl&eacute;n&nbsp;1973 </a>, which were re-measured later by <a onmouseover="self.status='Bibliographic Reference for Fe I';return true;" onmouseout="self.status='';return true;" target="_blank" href="javascript:void(0)" onclick="popded('https://physics.nist.gov/cgi-bin/ASBib1/get_ASBib_ref.cgi?db=el&amp;db_id=11520&amp;comment_code=&amp;element=Fe&amp;spectr_charge=1&amp;type=E');return false">Whaling&nbsp;et&nbsp;al.&nbsp;1995 </a> and found to be systematically too small. To account for this calibration error, the original measured wavenumbers and energy level values from Nave et al. 1994 have been increased here by 6.7 parts in 10<sup>8</sup>. The ionization energy is from <a onmouseover="self.status='Bibliographic Reference for Fe I';return true;" onmouseout="self.status='';return true;" target="_blank" href="javascript:void(0)" onclick="popded('https://physics.nist.gov/cgi-bin/ASBib1/get_ASBib_ref.cgi?db=el&amp;db_id=7743&amp;comment_code=&amp;element=Fe&amp;spectr_charge=1&amp;type=E');return false">Schoenfeld&nbsp;et&nbsp;al.&nbsp;1995 </a>, adjusted by the same scaling factor.
    </td>
    <td class='bcn2'>
      <A HREF="javascript:void(0)" ONCLICK="popbib('https://physics.nist.gov/cgi-bin/ASBib1/Elevbib/make_query.cgi?spectra=Fe%20I&amp;method=EL&amp;method=TE&amp;method=ND&amp;method=IP&amp;method=SF&amp;method=QF&order=1');return false"
        ONMOUSEOVER="self.status='Fe  I: bibliography energy levels query';return true;"
        ONMOUSEOUT="self.status=''; return true;" TARGET=_blank>Literature on Fe  I Energy Levels</A>
    </td>
  </tr>
</table>
  <br>
